            Get on Obsidian
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/Sikoso774/Nebulux"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn-outline"
          >
            <Icon name="github-outline" size={16} />
            View Code
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card project-card">
        <h3>Music Player</h3>
        <p>
          Desktop music player built with Python and Tkinter featuring a clean
          GUI for browsing and playing local audio files.
        </p>
        <div class="tags">
          <span>Python</span>
          <span>Tkinter</span>
          <span>GUI</span>
        </div>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/Sikoso774/Music_Player"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="btn-outline"
        >
          <Icon name="github-outline" size={16} />
          View Code
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="card project-card">
        <h3>HYPNOTICA</h3>
        <p>
          A 2nd year ENSEA project showcasing innovative approaches to
          interactive applications. Built with modern technologies and focusing
          on user experience.
        </p>
        <div class="tags">
          <span>Python</span>
          <span
            ><a
              href="https://pyga.me/docs"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer">Pygame</a
            ></span
          >
          <span>Web Development</span>
        </div>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/Sikoso774/HYPNOTICA_V4"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="btn-outline"
        >
          <Icon name="github-outline" size={16} />
          View Code
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="card project-card">
        <h3>zolenikokolo.com</h3>
        <p>
          Personal portfolio built entirely from scratch in pure HTML/CSS/JS —
          no templates, no frameworks. Designed, coded, and deployed via GitHub
          Pages end-to-end.
        </p>
        <div class="tags">
          <span>HTML/CSS</span>
          <span>JavaScript</span>
          <span>GitHub Pages</span>
          <span>Web Deployment</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card project-card">
        <h3>Scratch Programming Workshop</h3>
        <p>
          Created an engaging introduction to programming for children,
          developing curriculum materials and interactive exercises to make
          coding accessible and fun.
        </p>
        <div class="tags">
          <span>Education</span>
          <span>Scratch</span>
          <span>Teaching</span>
          <span>Curriculum Design</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card project-card">
        <h3>Data Science Projects</h3>
        <p>
          Collection of data analysis and visualization projects using Python,
          Pandas, Numpy, and Matplotlib. Exploring patterns, insights, and
          predictive modeling.
        </p>
        <div class="tags">
          <span>Python</span>
          <span>Pandas</span>
          <span>Numpy</span>
          <span>Matplotlib</span>
          <span>Data Analysis</span>
        </div>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/Sikoso774/Python"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="btn-outline"
        >
          <Icon name="github-outline" size={16} />
          View Code
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
